Wait for fluentd to tail late log files.

check-logs.sh fails a job when a log file under /var/log/kolla has no
"following tail of" line in fluentd.log, but never waits for one.
in_tail only finds new files every refresh_interval, 60 seconds by
default, so a service logging just before the check looks missing.

Retry for three refresh intervals before failing. This only sleeps
when there is a gap, so a healthy job is unaffected.

Prompt: Michael asked why change 976889 was given a Verified-1 by an
unrelated check-logs.sh failure, and then for a fix.

